# IMO 2014 P4
# P, Q on BC with angle conditions.
# M = mirror A through P; N = mirror A through Q.
# X = BM ∩ CN. O circumcenter. Prove AO = XO.

triangle A B C
on_line P B C
eqangle B A C A P B
on_line Q B C
eqangle A B C C A Q
mirror M A P
mirror N A Q
inter_ll X B M C N
circumcenter O C B A
prove_cong A O X O
